title: "btrg_catalog: MeerKLASS Bent-Tail Radio Galaxy Catalog Construction Workflow"
abstract: >
  This repository contains the core scripts, configuration files, and
  documentation used to construct and validate a catalog of bent-tail
  radio galaxies identified in the MeerKLASS survey.
